{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive against hordes of enemies, but you are not alone.<br> <br>A survivors-like with a twist: In addition to upgrading Weapons and Talents, you may also upgrade Allies to fight alongside you. <br> <br>Combine upgrades for unique outcomes. Soldiers + Priests = Paladins that deal damage and heal! Sword + Fire = Flaming Sword which burns as it strikes! Mage + AOE = Meteors which fall from the sky! <br> <br>When your mana is full, activate your Hero's unique ability for devastating effect. <br> <br>Get stronger with each run, with tons of upgrades to unlock. <br> <br>Unlock unique Artefacts for broken builds. <br> <br><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short 20 minute sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100s of Weapons, Talents, Allies and combinations to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple factions, heroes and maps to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more to be announced!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822490?t=1760351548","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822490/cca53675a09c1db295f21952d300f288cbc17022/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760351548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822490/169762ba27627af953f04ee5febdeefec2144511/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760351548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822490/169762ba27627af953f04ee5febdeefec2144511/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760351548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"descrip